Reference bank
--------------
src/sonicproof/data/refbank.npz contains embeddings computed with Google's
EmbeddingGemma 2 from short clips generated with Stable Audio 3 Medium.
No audio is included, only the embeddings and short text titles.

Model
-----
The EmbeddingGemma 2 model (google/embeddinggemma-2) is not bundled with
Sonicproof. It is downloaded from Hugging Face on first run. The model is
released by Google under the Apache License, Version 2.0; its model card asks
that deployments follow the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy:
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy
